server.port=8080
spring.application.name=api-gateway

eureka.client.service-url.defaultZone=http://localhost:8761/eureka/

# optional actuator
management.endpoints.web.exposure.include=health,info


✅ Now API Gateway will forward /books/** requests to Book Service and /orders/** to Order Service, automatically load-balancing across instances.

